<!doctype html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#0b0126">
<title>AUniverse — Documentação Central do Projeto</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600&family=Sora:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{
  --space-void:#0b0126; --cosmic-surface:#241651; --nebula:#5701bc; --plasma:#074969;
  --mint:#d6fff6; --active:#10b981; --hiatus:#f59e0b; --explicit:#ef4444;
  --ink:#f8f5ff; --ink-soft:#c5bddc; --ink-dim:#958baa;
  --line:rgba(214,255,246,.14); --line-strong:rgba(214,255,246,.28);
  --surf-soft:rgba(36,22,81,.62); --surf-deep:rgba(11,1,38,.78);
  --font-display:"Sora",sans-serif; --font-body:"Inter",sans-serif; --font-mono:"JetBrains Mono",monospace;
  --r-sm:10px; --r-md:16px; --r-lg:24px;
  --shadow-card:0 18px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.25); --shadow-glow:0 0 48px rgba(87,1,188,.32);
  --sidebar-w:264px;
}
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{
  margin:0; min-width:320px; color:var(--ink); font-family:var(--font-body); font-size:16px; line-height:1.6;
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle at 88% -10%, rgba(87,1,188,.32), transparent 36rem),
    radial-gradient(circle at -10% 40%, rgba(7,73,105,.22), transparent 30rem),
    var(--space-void);
  min-height:100vh;
}
a{color:inherit}
button,input,textarea,select{font:inherit}
button{cursor:pointer}
:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--mint); outline-offset:2px}
h1,h2,h3,h4{margin:0; font-family:var(--font-display); letter-spacing:-.02em}
p{margin:0}
.mono{font-family:var(--font-mono)}
.eyebrow{color:var(--mint); font:600 11px/1.4 var(--font-mono); letter-spacing:.12em; text-transform:uppercase}
.muted{color:var(--ink-soft)}
.dim{color:var(--ink-dim)}
ul{margin:0; padding:0}
li{list-style:none}

/* ---------- shell layout ---------- */
.shell{display:flex; min-height:100vh}
.sidebar{
  width:var(--sidebar-w); flex:0 0 auto; position:sticky; top:0; height:100vh; overflow-y:auto;
  border-right:1px solid var(--line); background:rgba(11,1,38,.55); backdrop-filter:blur(20px);
  padding:22px 16px 24px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:22px; z-index:20;
}
.brand{display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; padding:2px 6px 14px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.brand-mark{display:grid; place-items:center; width:34px; height:34px; border-radius:50%; border:1px solid var(--line-strong); color:var(--mint); box-shadow:var(--shadow-glow); flex:0 0 auto}
.brand-mark svg{width:18px; height:18px}
.brand-text{font:700 16px var(--font-display); line-height:1.15}
.brand-text small{display:block; font:500 10px var(--font-mono); color:var(--ink-dim); letter-spacing:.08em; text-transform:uppercase}

.navgroup + .navgroup{margin-top:2px}
.navgroup-label{padding:0 10px 6px; font:600 10px var(--font-mono); letter-spacing:.12em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--ink-dim)}
.navlist{display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:3px}
.navlink{
  display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; min-height:42px; padding:0 10px; border-radius:var(--r-sm);
  color:var(--ink-soft); text-decoration:none; font:600 13px var(--font-display); border:1px solid transparent; background:none; width:100%; text-align:left;
}
.navlink svg{width:16px; height:16px; flex:0 0 auto; opacity:.85}
.navlink:hover{color:var(--ink); background:rgba(255,255,255,.04)}
.navlink[aria-current="page"]{color:var(--mint); background:linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(87,1,188,.35), rgba(87,1,188,.06)); border-color:var(--line-strong)}

.countdown-pill{margin-top:auto; padding:14px; border-radius:var(--r-md); border:1px solid var(--line-strong); background:linear-gradient(155deg, rgba(87,1,188,.35), rgba(7,73,105,.18)); box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)}
.countdown-pill .eyebrow{display:block; margin-bottom:6px}
.countdown-num{font:700 26px var(--font-display); color:var(--mint)}
.countdown-sub{font:500 11px var(--font-mono); color:var(--ink-soft); margin-top:2px}

main{flex:1 1 auto; min-width:0}
.panel-wrap{max-width:1180px; margin:0 auto; padding:40px 32px 120px}
.page{display:none}
.page.active{display:block; animation:fadein .35s ease}
@keyframes fadein{from{opacity:0; transform:translateY(6px)} to{opacity:1; transform:none}}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.page.active{animation:none}}

.page-head{margin-bottom:36px}
.page-head h1{font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,44px); line-height:1.05; margin-top:10px}
.page-head p{margin-top:14px; max-width:720px; color:var(--ink-soft); font-size:17px}

.card{border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:var(--r-lg); background:var(--surf-soft); padding:24px; box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)}
.card + .card{margin-top:18px}
.card h3{font-size:18px; margin-bottom:10px}
.grid{display:grid; gap:18px}
.grid-2{grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr))}
.grid-3{grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr))}
.grid-4{grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(180px,1fr))}

section.block{margin-top:44px}
section.block:first-of-type{margin-top:0}
.block-head{display:flex; align-items:baseline; justify-content:space-between; gap:16px; flex-wrap:wrap; margin-bottom:18px}
.block-head h2{font-size:clamp(22px,2.6vw,28px)}

/* color chips */
.color-card{border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:var(--r-md); overflow:hidden; background:var(--surf-soft)}
.color-swatch{height:80px}
.color-body{padding:12px 14px}
.color-body h4{font-size:14px}
.color-body .mono{font-size:11px; color:var(--ink-dim); margin-top:4px; display:block}

/* type specimens */
.type-card{border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:var(--r-md); background:var(--surf-soft); padding:18px}
.type-sample-h{font:700 30px var(--font-display); margin-top:8px}
.type-sample-b{font:400 16px var(--font-body); margin-top:8px; color:var(--ink-soft)}
.type-sample-m{font:500 13px var(--font-mono); margin-top:8px; color:var(--mint); letter-spacing:.06em}

/* team table */
.team-table{width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; font-size:14px}
.team-table th{text-align:left; font:600 11px var(--font-mono); text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.08em; color:var(--ink-dim); padding:8px 12px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-strong)}
.team-table td{padding:10px 12px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); vertical-align:top}
.team-table tr:last-child td{border-bottom:none}
.badge{display:inline-block; padding:2px 9px; border-radius:999px; font:600 10.5px var(--font-mono); letter-spacing:.04em; text-transform:uppercase}
.badge-be{background:rgba(7,73,105,.35); color:#8fd7ff; border:1px solid rgba(7,73,105,.7)}
.badge-fe{background:rgba(87,1,188,.28); color:#e4c9ff; border:1px solid rgba(87,1,188,.6)}
.badge-bd{background:rgba(16,185,129,.18); color:#7bf3c7; border:1px solid rgba(16,185,129,.5)}
.badge-design{background:rgba(214,255,246,.12); color:var(--mint); border:1px solid var(--line-strong)}
.badge-qa{background:rgba(245,158,11,.16); color:#ffd18a; border:1px solid rgba(245,158,11,.5)}
.badge-lead{background:rgba(239,68,68,.16); color:#ff9d9d; border:1px solid rgba(239,68,68,.45)}

/* glossary */
.term{border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:var(--r-md); background:var(--surf-soft); padding:16px 18px}
.term dt{font:700 15px var(--font-display); color:var(--mint)}
.term dd{margin:6px 0 0; color:var(--ink-soft); font-size:14px}

/* steps */
.steps{counter-reset:step; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:0}
.step{position:relative; padding:0 0 28px 44px; border-left:1px solid var(--line-strong)}
.step:last-child{border-color:transparent; padding-bottom:0}
.step::before{counter-increment:step; content:counter(step); position:absolute; left:-15px; top:0; width:30px; height:30px; border-radius:50%; display:grid; place-items:center; background:var(--nebula); color:#fff; font:700 13px var(--font-display); box-shadow:0 0 0 4px var(--space-void)}
.step h4{font-size:16px; margin-bottom:6px}
.step p{color:var(--ink-soft); font-size:14.5px}
.step code, .card code, .callout code{background:rgba(0,0,0,.35); border:1px solid var(--line); padding:2px 7px; border-radius:6px; font:500 12.5px var(--font-mono); color:var(--mint)}
.codeblock{background:rgba(0,0,0,.42); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:var(--r-sm); padding:14px 16px; font:500 12.5px/1.7 var(--font-mono); color:#c4f5e6; overflow-x:auto; white-space:pre}

.callout{border:1px solid var(--line-strong); border-radius:var(--r-md); padding:16px 18px; display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:flex-start}
.callout svg{flex:0 0 auto; width:20px; height:20px; margin-top:2px}
.callout-info{background:rgba(7,73,105,.2); color:var(--ink)}
.callout-info svg{color:#7fd6ff}
.callout-warn{background:rgba(245,158,11,.12)}
.callout-warn svg{color:var(--hiatus)}
.callout-open{background:rgba(87,1,188,.18)}
.callout-open svg{color:var(--mint)}

/* roadmap timeline */
.timeline{display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:0; position:relative}
.tl-item{display:grid; grid-template-columns:150px 26px 1fr; gap:0; align-items:start}
.tl-date{padding:20px 16px 20px 0; text-align:right; font:600 12px var(--font-mono); color:var(--ink-dim)}
.tl-rail{display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; padding-top:22px}
.tl-dot{width:16px; height:16px; border-radius:50%; border:3px solid var(--space-void); box-shadow:0 0 0 1px var(--line-strong); flex:0 0 auto}
.tl-line{flex:1; width:2px; background:var(--line-strong); margin-top:2px}
.tl-item:last-child .tl-line{display:none}
.tl-content{padding:14px 0 26px}
.tl-content h3{font-size:18px}
.tl-content .status-tag{margin-left:10px}
.tl-content p{margin-top:8px; color:var(--ink-soft); font-size:14.5px; max-width:640px}
.tl-content ul{margin-top:10px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:6px}
.tl-content li{color:var(--ink-soft); font-size:14px; padding-left:18px; position:relative}
.tl-content li::before{content:"—"; position:absolute; left:0; color:var(--ink-dim)}

.status-tag{display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; padding:3px 11px; border-radius:999px; font:600 11px var(--font-mono); text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.04em}
.status-dot{width:7px; height:7px; border-radius:50%}
.status-progress{background:rgba(245,158,11,.15); color:var(--hiatus)}
.status-progress .status-dot{background:var(--hiatus)}
.status-todo{background:rgba(255,255,255,.06); color:var(--ink-dim)}
.status-todo .status-dot{background:var(--ink-dim)}
.status-done{background:rgba(16,185,129,.15); color:var(--active)}
.status-done .status-dot{background:var(--active)}

/* status overview table */
.status-table{width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; font-size:14px}
.status-table th{text-align:left; padding:9px 12px; font:600 11px var(--font-mono); text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--ink-dim); border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-strong)}
.status-table td{padding:11px 12px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}

/* issue cards */
.issue{border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:var(--r-md); background:var(--surf-soft); padding:18px 20px}
.issue + .issue{margin-top:12px}
.issue-top{display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; flex-wrap:wrap; justify-content:space-between}
.issue-id{font:700 12px var(--font-mono); color:var(--mint)}
.issue-title{font:700 15.5px var(--font-display); margin-top:6px}
.issue-tags{display:flex; gap:6px; flex-wrap:wrap}
.tag{padding:2px 9px; border-radius:999px; font:600 10.5px var(--font-mono); text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.03em; border:1px solid var(--line-strong); color:var(--ink-soft)}
.tag-urgente{border-color:rgba(239,68,68,.5); color:#ff9d9d; background:rgba(239,68,68,.1)}
.tag-alta{border-color:rgba(245,158,11,.5); color:var(--hiatus); background:rgba(245,158,11,.08)}
.tag-media{border-color:rgba(7,73,105,.6); color:#8fd7ff; background:rgba(7,73,105,.16)}
.tag-baixa{border-color:var(--line-strong); color:var(--ink-dim)}
.issue-desc{margin-top:10px; color:var(--ink-soft); font-size:14px}
.issue ul{margin-top:10px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:5px}
.issue li{font-size:13.5px; color:var(--ink-soft); padding-left:20px; position:relative}
.issue li::before{content:"☐"; position:absolute; left:0; color:var(--ink-dim); font-family:var(--font-mono)}
.issue-note{margin-top:10px; font-size:12.5px; color:var(--ink-dim); font-style:normal}

.role-toggle{display:flex; gap:8px; margin-bottom:22px; flex-wrap:wrap}
.role-toggle button{padding:9px 16px; border-radius:999px; border:1px solid var(--line-strong); background:rgba(255,255,255,.03); color:var(--ink-soft); font:600 13px var(--font-display)}
.role-toggle button.active{background:var(--nebula); color:#fff; border-color:var(--nebula)}
.role-panel{display:none}
.role-panel.active{display:block}

/* checklist grid for MVP */
.checklist{display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:8px}
.checklist li{display:flex; gap:10px; align-items:flex-start; font-size:14px; color:var(--ink-soft); padding-left:0}
.checklist li::before{display:none}
.checklist .box{flex:0 0 auto; width:16px; height:16px; border:1.5px solid var(--line-strong); border-radius:4px; margin-top:2px}

/* legislation */
.law-card{border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:var(--r-md); background:var(--surf-soft); padding:20px}
.law-card .eyebrow{display:block; margin-bottom:6px}

/* test template */
.template-box{border:1px dashed var(--line-strong); border-radius:var(--r-md); padding:20px; background:rgba(0,0,0,.18)}
.field-row{display:grid; grid-template-columns:180px 1fr; gap:10px; padding:9px 0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); font-size:14px}
.field-row:last-child{border-bottom:none}
.field-row .label{font:600 12px var(--font-mono); color:var(--ink-dim); text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.05em}

.email-cta{display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; margin-top:14px; padding:12px 18px; border-radius:999px; background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--nebula),#7a1fe0); color:#fff; font:700 14px var(--font-display); text-decoration:none; box-shadow:var(--shadow-glow)}
.email-cta svg{width:16px; height:16px}

table.simple{width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; font-size:13.5px}
table.simple th{text-align:left; padding:8px 10px; font:600 11px var(--font-mono); color:var(--ink-dim); text-transform:uppercase; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-strong)}
table.simple td{padding:9px 10px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); color:var(--ink-soft)}

.footer-note{margin-top:60px; padding-top:20px; border-top:1px solid var(--line); font:500 12px var(--font-mono); color:var(--ink-dim)}

/* mobile: sidebar becomes top drawer */
.menu-btn{display:none; position:fixed; top:14px; left:14px; z-index:40; width:44px; height:44px; border-radius:50%; border:1px solid var(--line-strong); background:var(--surf-deep); color:var(--mint); align-items:center; justify-content:center; backdrop-filter:blur(10px)}
.menu-btn svg{width:20px; height:20px}
@media (max-width: 880px){
  .menu-btn{display:flex}
  .sidebar{position:fixed; left:0; top:0; transform:translateX(-102%); transition:transform .25s ease; width:min(300px,86vw); box-shadow:0 0 60px rgba(0,0,0,.6)}
  .sidebar.open{transform:translateX(0)}
  .panel-wrap{padding:80px 18px 100px}
  .tl-item{grid-template-columns:26px 1fr}
  .tl-date{display:none}
}
.scrim{display:none; position:fixed; inset:0; background:rgba(0,0,0,.5); z-index:15}
.scrim.show{display:block}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<button class="menu-btn" id="menuBtn" aria-label="Abrir navegação" aria-expanded="false">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="3" y1="6" x2="21" y2="6"/><line x1="3" y1="12" x2="21" y2="12"/><line x1="3" y1="18" x2="21" y2="18"/></svg>
</button>
<div class="scrim" id="scrim"></div>

<div class="shell">
  <aside class="sidebar" id="sidebar">
    <div class="brand">
      <div class="brand-mark"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M24 4 29.6 18.4 44 24l-14.4 5.6L24 44l-5.6-14.4L4 24l14.4-5.6L24 4Z"/><circle cx="24" cy="24" r="4.5"/></svg></div>
      <div class="brand-text">AUniverse<small>Central da Produção</small></div>
    </div>

    <div class="navgroup">
      <div class="navgroup-label">Visão do produto</div>
      <div class="navlist">
        <button class="navlink" data-target="sobre" aria-current="page">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 8v5l3 2"/></svg>
          Sobre o projeto
        </button>
        <button class="navlink" data-target="tutorial">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><path d="M4 5c4 0 5 1 8 1s4-1 8-1v14c-4 0-5 1-8 1s-4-1-8-1V5Z"/></svg>
          GitHub &amp; Linear
        </button>
        <button class="navlink" data-target="roadmap">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><path d="M4 19V5m0 14h6m-6 0 4-4m10-10v14m0-14h-6m6 0-4 4"/></svg>
          Roadmap &amp; Milestones
        </button>
        <button class="navlink" data-target="legislacao">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><path d="M12 3v18M5 7l-3 6a3 3 0 0 0 6 0l-3-6Zm14 0-3 6a3 3 0 0 0 6 0l-3-6ZM5 7h14M8 21h8"/></svg>
          Legislação
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="navgroup">
      <div class="navgroup-label">Backlog por cargo</div>
      <div class="navlist">
        <button class="navlink" data-target="backend">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><rect x="4" y="4" width="16" height="6" rx="1.5"/><rect x="4" y="14" width="16" height="6" rx="1.5"/><circle cx="8" cy="7" r=".6" fill="currentColor"/><circle cx="8" cy="17" r=".6" fill="currentColor"/></svg>
          Back-end
        </button>
        <button class="navlink" data-target="frontend">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="13" rx="1.5"/><path d="M8 21h8M12 17v4"/></svg>
          Front-end
        </button>
        <button class="navlink" data-target="bancodados">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><ellipse cx="12" cy="6" rx="8" ry="3"/><path d="M4 6v12c0 1.7 3.6 3 8 3s8-1.3 8-3V6M4 12c0 1.7 3.6 3 8 3s8-1.3 8-3"/></svg>
          Banco de Dados
        </button>
        <button class="navlink" data-target="design">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><path d="M12 3a9 9 0 1 0 0 18c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2 0-.5-.2-1-.5-1.3-.3-.4-.5-.8-.5-1.2 0-.9.7-1.5 1.5-1.5H16a4 4 0 0 0 4-4c0-4.4-3.6-8-8-8Z"/><circle cx="7.5" cy="10.5" r="1" fill="currentColor"/><circle cx="11" cy="7" r="1" fill="currentColor"/><circle cx="15" cy="8.5" r="1" fill="currentColor"/></svg>
          Design
        </button>
        <button class="navlink" data-target="qa">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><path d="M9 11l2 2 4-4"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/></svg>
          Escritores / QA
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="countdown-pill">
      <span class="eyebrow">Contagem regressiva</span>
      <div class="countdown-num" id="countdownNum">—</div>
      <div class="countdown-sub">até o lançamento Beta · 20/12/2026</div>
    </div>
  </aside>

  <main>
    <div class="panel-wrap">

      <!-- ======================= ABA 1 — SOBRE ======================= -->
      <section class="page active" id="page-sobre">
        <div class="page-head">
          <div class="eyebrow">Aba 01 · fundação</div>
          <h1>O que é o AUniverse</h1>
          <p>Uma plataforma social de leitura e escrita de AUs (Alternate Universes), onde autores compõem narrativas multimodais em blocos e leitores vivem uma experiência imersiva e social. Esta página é a fonte única de verdade para quem entra no time — conceitos, pessoas, paleta e tipografia.</p>
        </div>

        <section class="block">
          <div class="block-head"><h2>Visão geral</h2></div>
          <div class="card">
            <p class="muted">Escritores e leitores de fanfics em formato AU hoje se dividem entre redes sociais convencionais (dinâmicas, mas sem ferramentas de leitura contínua e catalogação) e plataformas tradicionais de texto (Wattpad, AO3 — sem suporte nativo a chats, posts e imagens interativas). O AUniverse resolve essa fragmentação com um <strong>editor por blocos</strong>: o mesmo capítulo pode intercalar narração, chat, post de rede social, imagem e divisor de cena, exatamente como uma AU é vivida nas redes — só que organizada.</p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="block">
          <div class="block-head"><h2>Dicionave — vocabulário oficial</h2></div>
          <p class="muted" style="margin-bottom:16px">Todos os fluxos, telas e documentos do projeto usam estes termos. Use-os também em conversas e commits para manter consistência.</p>
          <dl class="grid grid-3" style="display:grid">
            <div class="term"><dt>Obra</dt><dd>Uma história/AU completa — metadados (título, sinopse, fandom, gênero, tags) + capítulos.</dd></div>
            <div class="term"><dt>Capítulo</dt><dd>Unidade narrativa dentro de uma obra, formada por uma sequência ordenada de blocos.</dd></div>
            <div class="term"><dt>Bloco</dt><dd>A menor unidade narrativa: Narração, Chat, Imagem/Mídia ou Social Media (V2+).</dd></div>
            <div class="term"><dt>Motor de Blocos</dt><dd>Sistema que renderiza corretamente cada tipo de bloco durante a leitura.</dd></div>
            <div class="term"><dt>Bloco Explícito</dt><dd>Bloco marcado como conteúdo sensível (adulto, violência, gatilhos) — pode exigir aviso prévio.</dd></div>
            <div class="term"><dt>Viajante</dt><dd>Papel de leitor: lê, ecoa, comenta, salva obras e organiza a biblioteca.</dd></div>
            <div class="term"><dt>Arquiteto</dt><dd>Papel de autor: cria, edita e publica obras, capítulos e blocos.</dd></div>
            <div class="term"><dt>Espectro</dt><dd>Feed principal — linha do tempo social onde autores divulgam obras.</dd></div>
            <div class="term"><dt>Estação</dt><dd>Biblioteca pessoal do Viajante — lendo agora, já lidas, pastas.</dd></div>
            <div class="term"><dt>Scanner</dt><dd>Busca e descoberta — tags, gênero, fandom, popularidade, histórico.</dd></div>
            <div class="term"><dt>Observatório</dt><dd>Perfil público — informações, obras publicadas, estatísticas.</dd></div>
            <div class="term"><dt>Reespectar</dt><dd>Ação equivalente a "retweetar" — divulga e fixa uma obra/post no próprio perfil.</dd></div>
          </dl>
          <p class="dim" style="margin-top:14px; font-size:13px">Um mesmo usuário pode alternar livremente entre os papéis de Viajante e Arquiteto.</p>
        </section>

